{"id":"3ef79db1b9c33fef","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/614_Lewis_反事实逻辑_VW.md","title":"614 Lewis 反事实逻辑 VW","display":"614_Lewis_反事实逻辑_VW","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span>，显示</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span> 是满足下列子句的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{614}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由变元子句：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{614}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{614}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中替换子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\square\\!\\!\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\square\\!\\!\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{614}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{614}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{614}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{614}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{614}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{614}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{614}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{614}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,614}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,614}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{614}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{614}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{614}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{614}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{614}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{614}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Lewis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 核心：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{614}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{614}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{614}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\lor(A\\square\\!\\!\\to\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{614}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\lor(A\\square\\!\\!\\to\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{614}\n=\n\\{((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\land(B\\square\\!\\!\\to A))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{614}\n=\n\\{((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\land(B\\square\\!\\!\\to A))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>VW 弱中心性公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{VW}^{614}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{VW}^{614}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{614}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{614}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{VW}^{614}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{614}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{614}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{VW}^{614}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{614}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{614}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{614}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{614}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{614}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{614}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{614}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{614}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{614}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{614}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{614}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>。每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{614}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{614}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{614}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{614}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{614}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{614}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{614}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{614}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{614}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{614}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{614}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{614}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{614}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{614}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{614}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{614}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{614}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{614}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{614}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{614}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{614}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)}\\;(RCF),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{614}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{614}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)}\\;(RCEA).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{614}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{614}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)}\\;(RCF),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{614}A\\leftrightarrow B}{\\vdash_{614}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)}\\;(RCEA).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-相似选择语义\">8. 相似选择语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"614\">\\(614\\)</span>-Lewis VW 模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{614}^{W}\">\\(\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{614}^{W}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，并满足 V-核心约束</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)|\\le1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)|\\le1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq Y\\land\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y)\\subseteq X\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)=\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq Y\\land\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y)\\subseteq X\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)=\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及弱中心约束</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w\\in X\\land \\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow w\\in Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w\\in X\\land \\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow w\\in Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{614}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{614}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{614}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{614}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{614}^{W}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{614}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{614}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{614}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{614}^{W}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{614}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{614}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"614\">\\(614\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"613\">\\(613\\)</span> 的差异是 VW 弱中心性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{VW}^{614}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{VW}^{614}\\)</span>：它要求反事实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\">\\(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\)</span> 推出材料条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span>，而不加入 VC 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\">\\((A\\land B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>VW 的目标差异被写成明确公式族，不依赖任何“弱中心世界”语义说明。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LewisVW}_{614}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\operatorname{FV}_{614},\\operatorname{BV}_{614},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{614},\\operatorname{Sub}_{614},\\equiv_{\\alpha,614},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{614},\\mathsf{Rule}_{614},\\mathsf{Proof}_{614},\\operatorname{last}_{614},\n\\vdash_{614},\\mathsf{Thm}_{614},\\mathsf{Cert}_{614},\n\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{614}^{W},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{614},\\Vdash_{614},\\models_{614}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LewisVW}_{614}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\operatorname{FV}_{614},\\operatorname{BV}_{614},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{614},\\operatorname{Sub}_{614},\\equiv_{\\alpha,614},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{614},\\mathsf{Rule}_{614},\\mathsf{Proof}_{614},\\operatorname{last}_{614},\n\\vdash_{614},\\mathsf{Thm}_{614},\\mathsf{Cert}_{614},\n\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{614}^{W},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{614},\\Vdash_{614},\\models_{614}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含句法反事实演算、弱中心选择语义、满足关系与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-相似选择语义","text":"8. 相似选择语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(B),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{614}(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{614}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{614}","display":fals